## Layer Modules (AppModule imports)

| Layer module | Feature modules | HTTP prefix |
|--------------|-----------------|-------------|
| `SystemModule` | `DatabaseModule`, `MailModule` | `system/` |
| `AccessModule` | `AuthModule`, `UserModule`, `CompanyModule`, `UserCompanyModule`, `InviteModule` | `access/` |
| `BusinessModule` | `ClientModule`, `CampaignModule` | `business/` |
| `MediaModule` | `PlatformModule`, `FormatModule`, `GroupingModule` | `media/` |
| `BridgeModule` | Catalog, PlatformAccount, PlatformObjectMap | `bridge/` |

## TypeORM Pattern

- **Root connection**: `DatabaseModule` → `TypeOrmModule.forRootAsync` + `ConfigService`
- **Feature repos**: `TypeOrmModule.forFeature([Entity])` in each module that needs DB access
- **Injection**: `@InjectRepository(Entity)` — never use custom provider tokens
- **CLI**: `typeormFile.ts` at `src/system/database/` reuses `buildTypeOrmConfig()`
- **Entities glob**: `src/**/*.entity.ts` via `__dirname + '/../../**/*.entity{.ts,.js}'`

## Auth

- Global `AuthGuard` registered via `APP_GUARD` in `AuthModule` (`src/access/auth/`)
- JWT stored in `access_token` cookie (also accepts `Authorization` header)
- `@CurrentUser()` returns `UserSignature` (`id`, `name`, `role`, `companyIds`)
- `Role` enum lives in `src/shared/role.enum.ts`
- Public routes: `POST /access/auth/login`, `POST /access/auth/logout`, `POST /access/auth/password/forgot`, `POST /access/auth/password/reset`

## Swagger

- UI at **`/api`** — config in `src/shared/swagger/swagger.config.ts`, wired in `main.ts`
- Controllers use `@ApiTags(layerTag(Layer.X, 'Resource'))` from `src/shared/swagger/layer-tags.ts`
- `x-tagGroups` collapses endpoints by domain layer in Swagger UI

## Cross-Module Wiring

- `AuthModule` imports `MailModule` (`src/system/mail/`) for password-reset emails
- `InviteModule` imports `MailModule` for invite emails
- `UserModule` imports `UserCompanyModule` for membership projections

## Conventions

- **New entity**: create under `src/<layer>/<feature>/`; register in layer feature module; update [domain-model.md](mdc:.cursor/skills/create-entities/domain-model.md)
- **Shared enums/types**: `src/shared/`
- **Module order in `AppModule`**: `SystemModule` first (DatabaseModule), then `AccessModule` (AuthGuard)
- **Env config**: global `ConfigModule` reads `./.env.${process.env.NODE_ENV}`
- **Do not edit**: `dist/`, `node_modules/`, `infra/postgres_data/`

## Commands

```bash
npm run start:dev                                              # Dev server
docker compose up                                              # App :8090, Postgres :55432
npm run build && npm run migration:generate src/system/database/migrations/<name>
npm run migration:run                                          # Apply migrations
npm run migration:show                                         # Migration status
npm run seed:run       # Run all layer seeds
npm run seed:access    # Access layer only
npm run seed:business  # Business layer only
npm run seed:media     # Media layer only
```
